&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans, the development hereby approved shall not be occupied until details of a revised cycle storage location for each unit, including their
size,&amp;nbsp; and appearance, have been submitted to, and approved in writing
by the local planning authority. The development must be carried out in
accordance with those approved details prior to first occupation and thereafter
retained.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

